{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They don\u2019t run. But you do.</strong><br>You leap through fractured minds, shaped by rage, sorrow, or silence. Each level is a soul, trapped in memory.<br>You're not just passing through; you\u2019re breaking chains. Maybe your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour</strong> is a physics-based platformer wrapped in a spiritual journey.<br>You collect light, unlock cages, and awaken what was forgotten.<br>The world breathes with each soul, fog, ruins, frozen time.<br>Music shifts. Light trembles.<br>And something inside... waits for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/d1abf0d2d222e4c0fa0f896802da1d85.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/d1abf0d2d222e4c0fa0f896802da1d85.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Parkour, Pure Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No powers. No shortcuts. Only real, weighty, momentum-based movement that punishes hesitation and rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/9225fc172357eceac285c7f50baaa8f8.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/9225fc172357eceac285c7f50baaa8f8.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood Is the Price of Passage </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miscalculations have consequences. Falls leave marks. Every mistake is visceral, blood, and impact. You won\u2019t just feel failure. You\u2019ll see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Soul Shapes Its Level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage reflects the inner world of a trapped soul, formed by rage, grief, silence, or longing. The architecture, the light, the tension; all echo the soul\u2019s personality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Labyrinth of Minds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just moving through space; you\u2019re navigating memories, traumas, and forgotten thoughts. Every level is a mental maze where the challenge is both physical and emotional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Free the Souls, Open the Way </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Gather light. Unlock the cage. Open spiritual portals that carry you from one haunted mind to the next. This isn\u2019t just progress, it\u2019s liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=200 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.mp4?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour is now on Steam!\u00a0Join to the Playtest now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious? Add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and get ready to jump in when the time comes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740800?t=1769010157","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/8eeebbc7c51e944cfd8e91c1d7c8b2f9653bbdb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769010157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/c5dc390c50f6a4aa49ecc7f3743755846fa623fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769010157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/c5dc390c50f6a4aa49ecc7f3743755846fa623fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769010157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains stylized violence and blood effects when the player character is injured. There are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, drug use, or self-harm. The tone is intense at times, but there is no explicit mature content beyond blood-related visuals.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They don\u2019t run. But you do.</strong><br>You leap through fractured minds, shaped by rage, sorrow, or silence. Each level is a soul, trapped in memory.<br>You're not just passing through; you\u2019re breaking chains. Maybe your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour</strong> is a physics-based platformer wrapped in a spiritual journey.<br>You collect light, unlock cages, and awaken what was forgotten.<br>The world breathes with each soul, fog, ruins, frozen time.<br>Music shifts. Light trembles.<br>And something inside... waits for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/d1abf0d2d222e4c0fa0f896802da1d85.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/d1abf0d2d222e4c0fa0f896802da1d85.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Parkour, Pure Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No powers. No shortcuts. Only real, weighty, momentum-based movement that punishes hesitation and rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/9225fc172357eceac285c7f50baaa8f8.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/9225fc172357eceac285c7f50baaa8f8.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood Is the Price of Passage </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miscalculations have consequences. Falls leave marks. Every mistake is visceral, blood, and impact. You won\u2019t just feel failure. You\u2019ll see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Soul Shapes Its Level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage reflects the inner world of a trapped soul, formed by rage, grief, silence, or longing. The architecture, the light, the tension; all echo the soul\u2019s personality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Labyrinth of Minds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just moving through space; you\u2019re navigating memories, traumas, and forgotten thoughts. Every level is a mental maze where the challenge is both physical and emotional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Free the Souls, Open the Way </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Gather light. Unlock the cage. Open spiritual portals that carry you from one haunted mind to the next. This isn\u2019t just progress, it\u2019s liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.poster.avif?t=1769010157\" width=200 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.webm?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.mp4?t=1769010157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour is now on Steam!\u00a0Join to the Playtest now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious? Add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and get ready to jump in when the time comes.</p>","developers":["massivefx"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/ef89b754edba38f4e65c8450a90bef347bf67bf6/header.jpg?t=1769010157","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3740800/1929361494/2a651500e7ba920ff2eb4bbfc65a9bb3133b75f4/1750432805/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747398495","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3740800/1929361494/2a651500e7ba920ff2eb4bbfc65a9bb3133b75f4/1750432805/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747398495","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3740800/1929361494/2a651500e7ba920ff2eb4bbfc65a9bb3133b75f4/1750432805/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747398495","id":257139069,"name":"Harder Parkour Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139069/0a9be00a27b2423f88ff11c77e69e5cc72c62b87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747398495"}],"name":"Harder Parkour","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4460 / AMD 